WEBVTT

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.760
It's not what I had expected.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.490
Usually, you're not scared.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.610
I've been very scared in combat,

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.712
but most of the time when I was out there,

00:05:08.712 --> 00:05:09.839
I wasn't scared.

00:05:09.839 --> 00:05:11.366
I was very scared beforehand

00:05:11.366 --> 00:05:13.281
and incredibly scared afterwards,

00:05:13.281 --> 00:05:15.883
and that fear that comes afterwards can last years.

00:05:15.883 --> 00:05:17.835
I haven't been shot at in six years,

00:05:17.835 --> 00:05:20.188
and I was woken up very abruptly this morning

00:05:20.188 --> 00:05:23.433
by a nightmare that I was being strafed by aircraft,

00:05:23.433 --> 00:05:24.640
six years later.

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:26.374
I've never even been strafed by aircraft,

00:05:26.374 --> 00:05:29.750
and I was having nightmares about it.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.123
Time slows down.